ced by `tidy.toml`. To convert your existing file, run the new `tidyctl migrate-config` command.\n\n## Compatibility notes\n\n- Python 3.9 support has been dropped. Tidyctl now requires Python 3.10 or newer.\n- The `tidyctl clean --all` command is deprecated. It prints a warning in 2.0 and will be removed in 2.1.\n\nHappy tidying!","ttft_ms":2871,"type":"result","duration_ms":2881,"uuid":"67c7599b-9649-4693-9ac5-adc87eb80fba","ttft_stream_ms":1123,"time_to_request_ms":16,"first_content_frame_ms":1124,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
